invariant: INV-7
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: webpki_session_aes
builds: bin/webpki_session_aes
reason: a ServerHello may carry a different suite from the HelloRetryRequest
  it follows, which RFC 9846 section 4.2.4 makes an illegal_parameter. The
  retry's transcript and the keys after it would then belong to two
  suites, and a server could move the suite after the client committed to
  the retry.

--- old
    if (!info->hrr && h->suite != 0 && info->suite != h->suite) {
--- new
    if (0) {
